# Air bubble (renderer only, M5): rises from Resi's mouth every 40 frames
# while her chest is under water, 0.5 px/frame up to the water line.
# A small ring h with a 1 px w highlight top-left, no outline (it sits on
# clear water t/T and must stay light). Like the `dampf` particle it lives in
# `props`, the group without the k-outline rule (the engine looks sprites up
# by name). rise: the ring wobbles 4 px <-> 3 px.
sprite = blase
size   = 4x4
origin = 2,4
anim   = rise frames=2 ticks=8 loop
---
frame rise 0
.hh.
hw.h
h..h
.hh.
frame rise 1
....
.wh.
.h.h
..h.
